Write a {tone} email for being late for {event} using the following details:

- Recipient Name: {recipientName}
- Event Late for: {event}
- Will arrive in: {arrivalTime}
- Reason: {reason}
- Sender Name: {senderName}
- Sender Role: {senderRole}
- City: {city}

The email should be structured, not very long and clearly explain the situation to the recipient.
